  <aisolate:Question contextRef="c-1">Which payments to related parties are above 10,000 EUR?</aisolate:Question>
  <aisolate:Answer contextRef="c-1">These payments to related parties are above 10,000 EUR:
| counterparty | entry_date | amount_eur |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Harbour Lane Properties GmbH | 2025-10-03 | 48,500 EUR |
| Brightmoor Holdings GmbH | 2025-12-15 | 120,000 EUR |
</aisolate:Answer>
