  <aisolate:Question contextRef="c-2">Which payments to related parties are above 10,000 EUR?</aisolate:Question>
  <aisolate:Answer contextRef="c-2">The payment of €64,000 to Pellworth Agrar KG on 2025‑11‑10 exceeds the €10,000 threshold for related‑party payments. It requires supervisory‑board approval (with the interested member absent) and must be disclosed in the notes, per the Pellworth Foods related‑party policy.</aisolate:Answer>
